# Placeholder for asset files

The following image files should be added for the installer UI:

- icon.ico      - Application icon (256x256, multiple sizes)
- banner.bmp    - Installer banner (493x58 pixels)
- dialog.bmp    - Installer dialog background (493x312 pixels)

These files are optional. If not present, the installer will use default WiX UI images.

To create these files:
1. Use any image editor that supports ICO and BMP formats
2. Follow the size requirements above
3. Use the Keystone Core branding if available
